<div class="max-w-7xl m-auto">
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row space-y-4 md:space-y-0 md:space-x-4">
    <div class="md:w-1/2">
      <h1 class="text-3xl mb-4">
        {dgettext("frontend", "On claiming this persona")}
      </h1>

      <p>
        {dgettext(
          "frontend",
          "There hasn't been provided any email address alongside this persona within the feed(s). So we basically have to trust you, that you claim this persona responsibly."
        )}
      </p>

      <p>{dgettext("frontend", "If you click claim, the following will happen:")}</p>

      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>{dgettext("frontend", "You will gain access to this persona.")}</li>
        <li>
          {dgettext(
            "frontend",
            "Your email address will be added to this persona. It will be used to send emails to other users aiming to claim this persona as well."
          )}
        </li>
        <li>
          {dgettext(
            "frontend",
            "A permanent connection between your account and this persona will be established. That connection will stay in place, also if you will change persona data later on."
          )}
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl my-4">
        {dgettext("frontend", "A message of concern")}
      </h2>

      <p>
        <b>
          {dgettext(
            "frontend",
            "Please, only do claim this persona, if you are the person behind the persona yourself or if you are a legitimate representative of the group or organisation represented by the persona."
          )}
        </b>
      </p>

      <p>
        {dgettext(
          "frontend",
          "If we would have to spend time to deal with conflicting persona claiming issues manually, that time couldn't be available to bring the project forward. Worst case, this feature would be disabled all together."
        )}
      </p>

      <p>{dgettext("frontend", "So please act responsibly.")}</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-4">
        {dgettext("frontend", "Persona data")}
      </h2>

      <p>{dgettext("frontend", "You are about to claim the following persona:")}</p>

      <dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mt-4">
        <dt class="text-right">
          {dgettext("frontend", "PanoptikumID")}
        </dt>
        <dd class="col-span-2">
          {@persona.pid}
        </dd>

        <dt class="text-right">
          {dgettext("frontend", "Name")}
        </dt>
        <dd class="col-span-2">
          {@persona.name}
        </dd>

        <dt class="text-right">
          {dgettext("frontend", "Uri")}
        </dt>
        <dd class="col-span-2">
          {@persona.uri}
        </dd>

        <dt class="text-right">
          {dgettext("frontend", "Description heading")}
        </dt>
        <dd class="col-span-2">
          {@persona.description}
        </dd>

        <dt class="text-right">
          {dgettext("frontend", "Description")}
        </dt>
        <dd class="col-span-2">
          {@persona.long_description}
        </dd>

        <dt class="text-right">
          {dgettext("frontend", "Image")}
        </dt>
        <dd class="col-span-2">
          <a href={@persona.image_url}>
            {@persona.image_title}
          </a>
        </dd>

        <dt class="text-right">
          {dgettext("frontend", "Fediverse Address")}
        </dt>
        <dd class="col-span-2">
          <a href={@persona.fediverse_address}>
            {@persona.fediverse_address}
          </a>
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-4">
    <.link
      href={persona_frontend_path(@conn, :connect, @persona)}
      method="post"
      data-confirm={dgettext("frontend", "Are you sure?")}
      class="btn btn-warning"
    >{dgettext("frontend", "Claim")}</.link>
  </p>
</div>
